# {{label}}

What {{label}} is for a DSP, and the data it shows, in a few lines. Write down any rule that
isn't obvious from the code.

{{#switch}}
- **Switch:** `{{name}}`, off for every DSP until the platform owner switches it on.
{{/switch}}
{{^switch}}
- **Mandatory:** every DSP has it, with no switch to turn it off.
{{/switch}}
{{#permission}}
- **Permissions:** `{{name}}.view`{{#keeps}}, `{{name}}.collect`{{/keeps}}. Only owners hold them until a role grants them.
{{/permission}}
{{#api}}
- **API:** `GET {{apiPath}}`, behind `{{name}}.view`.
{{/api}}
{{#tables}}
- **Data:** `{{table}}`, in {{databaseLabel}}.
{{/tables}}
{{#keeps}}
- **Keeps:** {{siteLabel}}'s `{{collection}}` collection.
{{/keeps}}
{{#page}}
- **Page:** {{label}}, in a DSP's sidebar.
{{/page}}
{{#tab}}
- **Tab:** {{label}}, on {{hostLabel}}'s page.
{{/tab}}
{{#settings}}
- **Settings:** a {{label}} tab on a DSP's Settings page.
{{/settings}}
